---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Steward
    participant Edit as Edit page<br/>edit-report/[responseId]
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant Server as Server actions<br/>utils/supabase/queries.ts
    participant DB as Supabase DB

    Note over Steward,DB: Covers US 4.0.4. Platform: web. The edit page exists.<br/>"(proposed)" = the step is not in the code today.

    Steward->>Edit: Open own SIR from the site page and select Edit
    Edit->>Server: getFormResponseById(responseId)
    Server->>Auth: requireReportWriter: get caller from session
    Server->>DB: Read user_id of the form_responses row that is not archived
    alt Not approved, not the owner and not an admin, or the SIR is archived (AT 2)
        Server-->>Edit: Refuse "You are not allowed to view this report." No answers
        Edit-->>Steward: Show "Access Denied". No edit mode
    else Caller is the owner or an approved admin
        Server->>DB: Read answers
        DB-->>Server: Answers
        Server-->>Edit: Answers
        Edit->>Server: getResponseOwnerId(responseId)
        Server-->>Edit: Owner id (requireApprovedCaller)
        Edit->>Edit: isOwner or role admin<br/>(shows edit mode. The server already checked)
        Edit-->>Steward: Show SIR in edit mode (AT 1)
        Steward->>Edit: Change answers and select Save
        Edit->>Edit: Check required questions<br/>and image metadata
        alt A required answer is empty (AT 3)
            Edit-->>Steward: Block save. List missing questions
        else All required answers are present
            Edit->>Server: updateSiteInspectionAnswers(responseId, answers, date)
            Server->>Auth: requireReportWriter: get caller from session
            Server->>DB: Read owner of the SIR that is not archived
            alt Caller is not the owner or an approved admin (direct request)
                Server-->>Edit: Refuse "You are not allowed to change this report." No change
            else Caller is the owner or an approved admin
                Server->>DB: Update inspection_date
                Server->>DB: Delete old answers
                Server->>DB: Insert new answers
                DB-->>Server: Saved
                Server-->>Edit: Success
                Edit-->>Steward: Go to /sites?edited=true
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Edit,DB: The server actions use createServerSupabase, which bypasses RLS, so each one<br/>checks the caller first (#242, #251). Delete and insert are not in one transaction:<br/>a failed insert leaves the SIR with no answers.
    Note over Edit,DB: AT 4: the site page, admin site page and PDF export read answers,<br/>so they show the new answers. New photos use the new-report upload flow (not shown).
    Note over Steward,DB: An approved Admin can view and edit any SIR that is not archived.<br/>The server check allows it. Whether Admins should keep this right is still open.
